WEBVTT

01:43.853 --> 01:48.733
EPISODE 5: PRISONER OF LOVE

01:49.317 --> 01:50.151
What's this?

01:50.693 --> 01:52.320
Looks like you're awake.

01:53.321 --> 01:55.740
Were we dreaming just now?

01:56.241 --> 01:59.119
Yes. And this substance is dissolving us.

01:59.202 --> 02:00.453
In this very room.

02:00.954 --> 02:02.914
Please break down the door…

02:02.997 --> 02:05.917
Use your ability, Star Platinum.

02:07.752 --> 02:09.045
Hurry!

02:15.343 --> 02:17.262
You did it! Now drag me out!

02:17.345 --> 02:19.013
Let's get out of here!

02:19.681 --> 02:20.515
Hold on.

02:21.266 --> 02:23.226
What did you just say?

02:23.309 --> 02:25.186
Did you say "Star Platinum"?

02:25.270 --> 02:26.604
That's my Stand name.

02:28.022 --> 02:30.650
How do you know that, Jolyne?

02:31.234 --> 02:32.443
From the looks of it,

02:33.027 --> 02:35.905
we started dreaming
after I told you about Johngalli A.

02:36.489 --> 02:37.407
Which means

02:38.283 --> 02:40.869
you haven't seen my Stand ability yet.

02:41.536 --> 02:44.247
Since we are related,
you may be feeling its presence,

02:44.789 --> 02:47.083
but you couldn't have known its name.

02:49.919 --> 02:51.629
It's not adding up!

02:54.340 --> 02:55.258
This is

02:55.842 --> 02:56.968
not reality!

03:06.978 --> 03:09.105
Stone Ocean…

03:10.190 --> 03:11.107
Jolyne.

03:11.691 --> 03:14.485
You finally woke up.

03:14.569 --> 03:15.904
That took too much effort.

03:16.613 --> 03:18.114
My thread melts fast.

03:18.698 --> 03:21.326
Jolyne… You were dreaming too.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.995
I don't know about yours,

03:24.078 --> 03:26.372
but mine was a terrible nightmare.

03:26.456 --> 03:27.415
I see.

03:28.041 --> 03:30.835
So we were both dreaming

03:30.919 --> 03:32.253
as if watching a movie.

03:32.337 --> 03:36.216
Guess so. It would've been perfect
if only we had some popcorn.

03:36.841 --> 03:39.719
I can't move anymore. Not even a finger.

03:39.802 --> 03:42.680
What about you? Can you move?

03:42.764 --> 03:44.432
What we are perceiving

03:45.183 --> 03:47.018
could still be a dream.

03:47.894 --> 03:50.730
If you can't move at all,
then we're awake.

03:51.356 --> 03:53.274
We are in this reality

03:53.358 --> 03:55.109
where we can't escape this room.

03:55.193 --> 03:56.027
I see.

03:56.611 --> 03:59.239
We'll die at this rate.

04:00.156 --> 04:01.658
The charm's ability…

04:02.533 --> 04:04.953
Show me the ability you used
to wake me up.

04:06.204 --> 04:07.664
Stone Ocean.

04:07.747 --> 04:10.750
Yes. Can you materialize it?

04:10.833 --> 04:12.293
I mean your power.

04:12.377 --> 04:14.796
I understand, but it's no use.

04:14.879 --> 04:17.131
It was hard enough to wake you up.

04:17.215 --> 04:19.050
No way could I break down the door.

04:19.133 --> 04:21.010
No, just materialize it.

04:26.808 --> 04:28.101
That's it.

04:28.768 --> 04:29.686
Keep going.

04:30.395 --> 04:32.230
Can you bring it out a bit more?

04:32.313 --> 04:36.025
Move it slightly towards me.

04:37.318 --> 04:40.697
It'd be best if you could move it
a bit more to the left.

04:41.990 --> 04:43.616
This will do.

04:43.700 --> 04:45.994
It's not ideal, but it's close enough.

04:46.786 --> 04:49.205
Now we can leave this room.

04:59.924 --> 05:02.927
That was my Stand, "Star Platinum."

05:03.511 --> 05:07.015
Pull me out. This isn't a dream.
I'm certain of it now.

05:07.098 --> 05:09.183
Damn you…

05:10.977 --> 05:13.271
Bullshit…

05:13.938 --> 05:17.358
It hurts and I'm pissed.

05:17.442 --> 05:19.527
I can't believe you hit me.

05:20.153 --> 05:22.572
We got out, but I'm pissed!

05:22.655 --> 05:24.907
We're definitely not dreaming, all right!

05:35.585 --> 05:37.211
Okay, give me your hands.

05:37.920 --> 05:39.172
What now?

05:43.634 --> 05:44.469
Let's go.

05:45.261 --> 05:46.137
Oh, right.

05:47.388 --> 05:48.639
Do you know what this is?

05:49.599 --> 05:52.143
This bone saved our lives.

05:52.643 --> 05:53.728
It's a human bone.

05:54.604 --> 05:55.438
Plus,

05:56.147 --> 05:59.317
it's the sacrum from
the pelvic area of an adult female.

05:59.400 --> 06:03.488
Its surface looks like
it was dissolved with some kind of acid.

06:03.571 --> 06:04.864
Dissolved?

06:04.947 --> 06:06.616
Is that what was used on us?

06:06.699 --> 06:07.700
Can't say.

06:08.242 --> 06:11.829
I don't know why you have that bone,
but it doesn't matter now.

06:11.913 --> 06:13.790
I was the only one who saw that boy,

06:13.873 --> 06:15.583
but he's definitely here!

06:15.666 --> 06:18.544
It's a mystery,
but he's within these prison walls!

06:21.422 --> 06:24.133
Code 909, emergency level 4.

06:24.217 --> 06:26.803
Emergency alarm activated
in the visitation room.

06:26.886 --> 06:29.263
Emergency level 4, code 909.

06:29.347 --> 06:30.890
What's your plan now?

06:30.973 --> 06:33.768
I guess now you're a criminal too.

06:33.851 --> 06:35.561
Like I told you,

06:35.645 --> 06:37.188
I'm breaking you out.

06:37.814 --> 06:39.857
You have the charm, don't you?

06:42.402 --> 06:45.905
It's crucial that you hold onto it.
Don't lose it, no matter what.

06:47.615 --> 06:49.367
Let's go. We're leaving this place.

07:00.586 --> 07:04.841
Who would have thought that
they would be able to escape this room.

07:08.719 --> 07:11.139
Is it just me?
I don't see that many guards.

07:11.222 --> 07:13.015
This is a common area.

07:14.767 --> 07:15.601
Look at this.

07:18.187 --> 07:20.690
We'll escape through the window
marked with an X.

07:21.441 --> 07:23.526
This window faces the beach.

07:23.609 --> 07:26.529
We'll board a submarine at the beach
to escape this island.

07:27.113 --> 07:28.364
A submarine?

07:28.448 --> 07:30.867
I have an amicable relationship
with a group

07:30.950 --> 07:32.910
called The Speedwagon Foundation.

07:32.994 --> 07:34.829
They have provided our way out.

07:46.549 --> 07:49.260
There doesn't seem to be
a camera in this hallway.

07:49.343 --> 07:51.971
Our target window is one left turn away.

07:52.638 --> 07:54.932
Then we'll be about 20m
away from the shore.

07:55.933 --> 07:58.019
I'm sure there is a lot to consider,

07:58.102 --> 07:59.896
but let's get out of here first.

08:01.731 --> 08:02.565
Let's go.

08:09.530 --> 08:11.282
It's just the fan.

08:11.365 --> 08:12.617
Jolyne.

08:23.169 --> 08:24.754
It hurts!

08:25.296 --> 08:27.089
Where are you looking? Stay calm.

08:28.216 --> 08:29.717
Stand up.

08:34.639 --> 08:36.766
What's the matter? Give me your hand.

08:36.849 --> 08:39.143
It's just that…

08:39.227 --> 08:41.145
Well, thanks,

08:41.229 --> 08:43.397
but I can stand up by myself.

08:43.481 --> 08:44.732
That's not what I meant.

08:44.815 --> 08:48.110
You almost lost this.
Be careful when you trip.

08:48.194 --> 08:50.947
I told you not to lose this charm.

08:54.450 --> 08:55.493
What is it?

08:56.160 --> 08:57.620
I told you it's important.

08:58.287 --> 09:00.122
You must hold onto it. Take it.

09:04.418 --> 09:05.878
You're headed to Tokyo?

09:05.962 --> 09:09.048
This is your daughter we're talking about!

09:09.131 --> 09:10.591
And you call yourself her father?

09:11.217 --> 09:12.718
Hello? Are you there?

09:18.307 --> 09:20.142
You haven't changed a bit.

09:20.226 --> 09:23.229
You're calm and collected as ever.

09:23.312 --> 09:26.065
When I almost died from a fever,

09:26.148 --> 09:28.150
you didn't come home to check on me.

09:28.234 --> 09:31.445
When I drove a car for fun
and was accused of theft,

09:32.280 --> 09:35.199
you took a plane to Tokyo instead.

09:35.950 --> 09:38.911
Right. As long as I'm safe,
you don't care, do you?

09:42.540 --> 09:46.836
Even now, I'm just a troublemaker
that doesn't get hurt even if I fall! See?

09:46.919 --> 09:48.588
Lucky me, no harm done! Yahoo!

09:49.255 --> 09:50.798
What are you talking about?

09:53.384 --> 09:55.511
If it's that important, hold it yourself!

09:57.263 --> 09:58.097
Listen.

09:58.180 --> 09:59.599
Shut up. I don't want it!

09:59.682 --> 10:02.059
That's not it. Something is off.

10:03.060 --> 10:05.646
We're being quietly followed.

10:06.355 --> 10:07.523
Jolyne, duck.

10:23.581 --> 10:25.750
There's no one over here.

10:25.833 --> 10:27.710
They might have headed the other way.

10:27.793 --> 10:29.920
Oh, it's just a guard.

10:31.380 --> 10:33.341
Hey, look closely!

10:33.424 --> 10:35.551
The door is bent!

10:36.052 --> 10:38.846
The convicts have come this far!
We are at--

10:51.150 --> 10:52.985
That's…

10:57.531 --> 10:59.283
Johngalli A.!

11:03.079 --> 11:04.497
That bastard…

11:04.580 --> 11:06.749
He's here to finish us off himself!

11:07.249 --> 11:09.585
Jolyne! Head towards the window.

11:09.669 --> 11:11.003
I'll take care of him.

11:13.714 --> 11:15.508
That's Johngalli A.'s Stand!

11:16.008 --> 11:18.386
But the only time
he ambushed us was in a dream.

11:18.469 --> 11:20.680
-Die!
-Are we still dreaming?

11:25.059 --> 11:27.144
No! This is reality!

11:27.228 --> 11:29.480
Time stop!

11:36.112 --> 11:37.071
Our enemies…

11:37.154 --> 11:38.030
There are…

11:39.073 --> 11:40.282
two of them!

11:41.283 --> 11:43.202
Not only did he force us to dream,

11:43.285 --> 11:44.412
but he showed us

11:44.995 --> 11:47.665
Johngalli A.'s actual Stand within it!

11:48.207 --> 11:51.252
They had been preparing for this moment.

11:51.335 --> 11:52.753
The moment

11:52.837 --> 11:55.256
I have no choice
but to use my Stand ability

11:55.339 --> 11:56.841
to protect my daughter!

11:57.842 --> 11:59.301
Their target

11:59.385 --> 12:01.095
was me all along!

12:01.178 --> 12:02.847
Time will move again. Jolyne!

12:10.312 --> 12:12.690
You were one move behind.

12:12.773 --> 12:15.943
Jotaro Kujo, I have been waiting

12:16.444 --> 12:17.737
for this moment!

12:27.329 --> 12:29.999
It was just ready for me.

12:30.082 --> 12:31.292
Perfect.

12:31.375 --> 12:36.464
I finally got what I've been after
from Jotaro, the invincible Stand User!

12:36.547 --> 12:39.675
This is Pale Snake's ability!

12:42.094 --> 12:43.387
Those bullets!

12:48.559 --> 12:49.643
The Stand!

12:56.066 --> 12:56.901
How?

12:56.984 --> 12:59.779
I thought we only saw
his Stand in our dream!

12:59.862 --> 13:02.615
Anyway, while he can't shoot, I'll…

13:28.390 --> 13:30.518
I see the shore! We're close!

13:31.477 --> 13:32.686
Go on without me.

13:33.646 --> 13:34.730
I'll catch up.

13:35.523 --> 13:36.941
Were you actually…

13:37.733 --> 13:38.734
shot?

13:39.735 --> 13:43.656
Listen to me.
A Stand User only controls one Stand.

13:43.739 --> 13:46.116
This means we are up against two enemies,

13:48.118 --> 13:51.247
Johngalli A. and the one
who tried to dissolve us.

13:58.212 --> 13:59.547
Go on ahead.

13:59.630 --> 14:01.674
Take this charm.

14:01.757 --> 14:02.633
Don't drop it.

14:03.843 --> 14:06.554
A transmitter is implanted within it.

14:06.637 --> 14:08.347
It's there to track your location.

14:09.306 --> 14:14.562
The submarine is honed
to follow the GPS signal.

14:15.145 --> 14:17.314
You understand what I'm saying, right?

14:18.107 --> 14:21.569
All you have to do is go to the beach.
The submarine will come to you.

14:22.152 --> 14:26.866
And The Speedwagon Foundation
I told you about will find you.

14:30.494 --> 14:33.205
If you understand, then go, Jolyne.

14:34.164 --> 14:35.165
This charm…

14:35.958 --> 14:37.710
But earlier, you…

14:37.793 --> 14:39.837
No. You couldn't have…

14:40.713 --> 14:44.341
I've always cared about you.

14:51.849 --> 14:52.892
What is it?

14:52.975 --> 14:54.852
Your chest… You're not…

14:55.477 --> 14:57.021
No, why?

14:57.605 --> 14:59.106
Go, Jolyne.

14:59.189 --> 15:01.066
It's just a little blood.

15:01.150 --> 15:02.484
I'll catch up soon.

15:02.568 --> 15:03.569
Liar!

15:04.778 --> 15:06.697
Earlier, you sacrificed yourself,

15:06.780 --> 15:08.949
and the enemy took something from you!

15:09.575 --> 15:12.411
That's why you couldn't
evade the bullets, right?

15:13.120 --> 15:14.204
What did he take?

15:15.289 --> 15:16.874
Don't tell me… your Stand?

15:19.293 --> 15:20.461
Jolyne!

15:27.551 --> 15:28.385
What?

15:30.804 --> 15:32.556
These are…

15:32.640 --> 15:34.224
These threads!

15:34.308 --> 15:35.142
Since when?

15:36.477 --> 15:37.645
Take this!

15:44.360 --> 15:45.486
Shut up.

15:46.111 --> 15:50.199
We're about to leave from this window
and head for the beach.

15:50.866 --> 15:53.160
Don't get in our way. Got that?

15:53.786 --> 15:55.371
You…

15:55.955 --> 15:58.540
When did she acquire such a Stand ability?

15:58.624 --> 16:00.334
An ability of this strength

16:00.417 --> 16:03.712
should have been reported
before her sentencing!

16:04.922 --> 16:07.967
Very well. I will drop my gun.

16:18.602 --> 16:21.438
I wasn't asking you to drop your gun.

16:21.522 --> 16:23.774
I was just looking for the best angle.

16:23.857 --> 16:26.902
Your body's best angle to punch, that is.

16:27.611 --> 16:31.281
I only like it when your chin
is tilted slightly to the right.

16:31.865 --> 16:32.992
Just now,

16:33.075 --> 16:36.662
I should have finished her first
instead of Jotaro!

16:37.287 --> 16:39.707
Jotaro wasn't the one
I should've gone for first.

16:40.290 --> 16:43.502
Does Pale Snake know about this?

16:44.086 --> 16:45.713
Jolyne Cujoh.

16:45.796 --> 16:48.716
Without a doubt, she is Jotaro Kujo's…

16:48.799 --> 16:50.217
She's a Joestar!

16:54.096 --> 16:55.264
Jolyne.

16:55.347 --> 16:58.392
Back then, in that dream…

16:59.143 --> 17:01.353
you said you'll stay behind at this jail

17:02.062 --> 17:04.023
for some child you barely just met.

17:04.606 --> 17:07.109
He grabbed my arm
with desperation in his eyes.

17:07.192 --> 17:09.111
I'm going back inside.

17:09.194 --> 17:11.739
It was a mere dream I saw.

17:13.407 --> 17:14.283
But…

17:21.915 --> 17:22.750
Dad!

17:22.833 --> 17:25.502
Dammit, we're so close to the beach!

17:26.086 --> 17:28.630
Dad!

17:30.090 --> 17:32.843
Find them! We have permission to shoot!

17:32.926 --> 17:34.678
A guard has been shot.

17:34.762 --> 17:36.305
The convict is armed.

17:36.972 --> 17:38.599
We can shoot to kill!

17:41.143 --> 17:43.312
Where is it? I'm at the beach already.

17:43.896 --> 17:46.565
Where are they?
That organization you're friends with,

17:46.648 --> 17:49.109
called The Speedwagon Foundation…

17:49.193 --> 17:50.569
I don't know who they are,

17:51.153 --> 17:53.989
but if they really did send us
a submarine,

17:54.782 --> 17:58.952
then they must have incredibly
advanced technology and financial power!

17:59.536 --> 18:02.414
A gunshot wound like this…

18:02.498 --> 18:07.419
This foundation must be able to administer
the care you need better than anyone else!

18:07.503 --> 18:09.129
Where is the submarine?

18:09.713 --> 18:11.590
Where is it?

18:24.061 --> 18:26.980
Everything you said was true.

18:27.064 --> 18:29.441
The submarine is already at the beach!

18:29.525 --> 18:30.651
We're saved…

18:47.292 --> 18:49.962
What the hell are you doing?

18:52.172 --> 18:53.006
You can't…

18:53.590 --> 18:56.260
No, this can't be happening.

18:56.343 --> 18:58.345
No, this isn't happening.

18:58.428 --> 19:01.849
He was shot, but it wasn't deep.

19:01.932 --> 19:03.684
It's not a fatal wound.

19:05.477 --> 19:07.938
It can't be a fatal wound.

19:08.021 --> 19:08.856
Then,

19:10.274 --> 19:12.067
Then his heart…

19:13.318 --> 19:16.572
Why isn't it beating?

19:24.079 --> 19:25.747
Now, I know.

19:25.831 --> 19:27.833
The Joestar blood runs in you.

19:27.916 --> 19:31.336
Jolyne, with your strong conviction,

19:31.420 --> 19:33.505
I know you'll be fine.

20:08.582 --> 20:09.541
Found them!

20:09.625 --> 20:12.044
Something's moving
on the other side of the fence!

20:12.127 --> 20:13.170
Watch for the gun!

20:14.671 --> 20:16.924
No, I'm not outside the fence.

20:17.716 --> 20:18.967
I'm right here

20:19.051 --> 20:20.636
if you're looking for me.

20:23.680 --> 20:24.598
You!

20:24.681 --> 20:25.724
Hold, don't shoot!

20:26.308 --> 20:27.476
Her hands are up.

20:27.559 --> 20:29.436
-But…
-Don't shoot!

20:29.519 --> 20:30.520
She's unarmed.

20:31.605 --> 20:32.689
Are you surrendering?

20:35.734 --> 20:37.653
There must be another man.

20:38.153 --> 20:40.822
A tall man who visited her.

20:40.906 --> 20:42.908
He must be nearby. Find him!

20:46.411 --> 20:48.956
That's where you were.

20:53.877 --> 20:56.880
Why?

20:57.631 --> 20:59.216
Why didn't you run?

20:59.299 --> 21:02.427
I'm sorry,
but your father is already dead.

21:04.763 --> 21:08.350
His spirit was stolen by that sludge.

21:08.850 --> 21:11.395
You barely managed to survive!

21:11.478 --> 21:14.523
Why didn't you leave? Why?

21:15.983 --> 21:18.318
The murderer escaped inside the prison.

21:18.402 --> 21:20.028
Not outside, inside!

21:21.321 --> 21:24.992
The murderer had planned to steal
my father's Stand by giving it form.

21:25.075 --> 21:25.951
That's his ability!

21:26.034 --> 21:30.205
Then the murderer retreated
back into the prison.

21:30.289 --> 21:31.832
He won't leave this place.

21:31.915 --> 21:34.793
He is within these walls!

21:34.876 --> 21:38.463
Are you actually trying
to get his ability back?

21:38.547 --> 21:40.716
Do you think it'll bring him back to life?

21:40.799 --> 21:43.051
That's precisely why
I'm going back inside.

21:44.094 --> 21:48.598
I'm sorry to say this,
but a corpse will only rot away.

21:48.682 --> 21:51.852
That melted bone I gave you
belonged to my mother.

21:51.935 --> 21:53.520
That sludge stole her ability

21:53.603 --> 21:54.855
and she died.

21:56.606 --> 21:57.441
I see.

21:58.608 --> 22:01.778
My mom was an inmate here
and gave birth to me.

22:02.279 --> 22:04.740
I grew up in hiding within these walls.

22:05.407 --> 22:07.367
What's your name?

22:07.451 --> 22:10.287
I'm Emporio.

22:10.370 --> 22:11.830
Emporio.

22:11.913 --> 22:14.499
Your mother's bone saved my life.

22:15.208 --> 22:16.126
Thank you.

22:23.342 --> 22:24.468
But,

22:25.052 --> 22:27.429
I can't explain it, but I'm certain of it.

22:27.512 --> 22:30.182
My dad's not dead.

22:30.724 --> 22:33.226
If I get his Stand back,
he will come back to life.

22:34.269 --> 22:35.354
That's why

22:36.146 --> 22:37.064
I'm going back!

22:46.156 --> 22:47.199
You've done it.

22:48.200 --> 22:51.828
You finally acquired
this powerful Stand which can stop time!

22:52.829 --> 22:56.792
Yes, and I have you to thank, Johngalli A.

22:57.376 --> 22:59.753
We make a great team together.

23:01.838 --> 23:04.508
Please take me to the men's prison.

23:04.591 --> 23:05.967
I let my guard down.

23:08.595 --> 23:12.057
And have you seen my gun?

23:12.140 --> 23:12.974
It's right here.

23:22.484 --> 23:26.071
You're the only one who knows who I am.

23:26.655 --> 23:30.242
You shall be my scapegoat
for the murder of the guards.

23:30.325 --> 23:32.911
This way, everything works out peacefully.

23:33.620 --> 23:36.456
To be able to communicate
something to someone...

23:36.540 --> 23:40.544
